### Topic API samples

@host = https://localhost:5001
@inst = 0c250000-2021-11e7-89e2-1cbdb9e7fd04

### List topics
GET {{host}}/api/connect/topic?activeOnly=true
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}

### Main topics
GET {{host}}/api/connect/topic/mainTopics
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}

### Handles
GET {{host}}/api/connect/topic/handles
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}

### Create topics
POST {{host}}/api/connect/topic
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "name": "attendance.daily",
    "friendlyName": "Daily Attendance",
    "description": "Attendance alerts",
    "role": "Member",
    "category": "PrivateToInstitute",
    "access": "Open",
    "canUnsubscribe": true,
    "isSubscriptionAllowed": true,
    "tags": ["attendance"]
  }
]

### Create main topic
POST {{host}}/api/connect/topic/mainTopic
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "academic",
  "friendlyName": "Academic"
}

### Enable
POST {{host}}/api/connect/topic/enable
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "TOPIC_ID_HERE" }

### Disable
POST {{host}}/api/connect/topic/disable
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "TOPIC_ID_HERE" }

### Update friendly name
POST {{host}}/api/connect/topic/updateFriendlyName
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "TOPIC_ID_HERE", "value": "New Friendly Name" }

### Update handle
POST {{host}}/api/connect/topic/handle
X-Inst-Id: {{inst}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "TOPIC_ID_HERE", "handle": "attendance.daily.main" }
